  "brand": {
    "$description": "TIMP's brand: the logo, which is the app's icon (icons/icon.svg: the pocket on the teal, \"timp\" and the stitching in cream), the splash, the welcome screen's mark. The same in both themes; inside the app the days and the places keep their own colours (design/README.md, Brand).",
